<title>USA: Sears Roebuck and Co Feb same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Sears Roebuck and Co Feb same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	   $1,820.0   $1,720.0	+5.7	 +1.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage. Figures represent domestic store revenues. Total revenues for four weeks ended March 4 were $2.58 billion, up 6.9 percent from $2.42 billion in prior-year period.</p>
<p>    Month is	4 weeks ended	 March 2.</p>
<p>    Full company name is   Sears, Roebuck and Co</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
